    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{4},\\frac{5\\pi}{4}$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\n1&=2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\\\\n\\sin^2\\theta+\\cos^2\\theta&=2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta\\\\\n\\sin^2\\theta-2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta+\\cos^2\\theta&=0\\\\\n(\\sin\\theta-\\cos\\theta)^2&=0\\\\\n\\sin\\theta&=\\cos\\theta\\\\\n\\tan\\theta&=1\\\\\n\\theta&=\\frac{\\pi}{4},\\frac{5\\pi}{4}.\n\\end{align*}$$\nThese are the solutions in $[0,2\\pi]$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
